FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}Eh bien, vous avez pris tout votre
temps.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ça fait un moment que je
vous attends, moi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Remember that thing I borrowed
from you?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Well, I spaced out and
totally forgot I had it.
Anyway, I wanted to return it.
Sorry I had it for so long,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}¿Recuerdas eso que me prestaste?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pues es que se me fue la pinza y se
me olvidó hasta que lo tenía.
Y nada, quería devolvértelo.
Perdona por haberlo tenido
tanto tiempo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ti ricordi di quella cosa che mi
avevi prestato?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Beh, me ne sono
ricordato oggi all'improvviso.
Ecco, volevo solo ridartela.
Scusa se l'ho tenuta così a lungo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Mir ist vorhin eingefallen, dass ich
noch was von dir ausgeliehen hab.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich hatte das total vergessen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Na ja, hier hast du es wieder,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Recuerdas eso que buscabas?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pues nada, que lo he encontrado y
aquí lo tengo. {{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡¿A que soy majete?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti ricordi di quella cosa che stavi
cercando come un pazzo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ce l'ho qui! L'ho presa per te!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}È o non è un pensiero carino?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hani aradığın bir şey vardı ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bir tane
buldum, ben de senin için aldım.
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ne kadar düşünceliyim, değil mi?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
This is exactly what I was looking
for.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Thank you so much!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I don't know if you noticed,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I'm
extremely good at receiving gifts.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's one of my many talents.

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Genau danach hab ich gesucht.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tausend Dank!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Beschenkt werden ist übrigens eines
meiner vielen Talente. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Und mit
Sicherheit eines meiner schönsten!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Tam da aradığım şey bu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Çok teşekkür ederim!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Fark ettin mi bilmem,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ama hediye kabul
etme konusunda olağanüstü yetenekliyim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pek çok yeteneğimden biri.

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}He encontrado esto por ahí tirado,
cerca de la casa de {{TAG:0005:0022:00CD}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Pero estoy seguro de que es tuyo.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Le puedes echar un vistacito?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho trovato questo piccolo tesoro
vicino a casa di {{TAG:0005:0022:00CD}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ma secondo me ti appartiene{{TAG:0003:0015:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Vuoi darci un'occhiata?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Schau mal, das hier lag hinter dem
Haus, wo {{TAG:0005:0022:00CD}} wohnt.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Das gehört doch dir, oder?
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ich war vorhin rein zufällig da und
hab es gefunden.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bunu {{TAG:0005:0022:00CD}}ın evinin yakınlarında
buldum.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ama senin olduğuna epey eminim.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bir bakar mısın?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Me apetece tomar{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} pasta!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tú que
entiendes tanto de todo, ¿adónde
me recomiendas ir, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Pagherei oro per un bel piatto di{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pasta!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Dove si mangiano i migliori
bucatini{{TAG:0003:0017:}}, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You don't have to pretend.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
You just wanted to see me, isn't
that right?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Just say so!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Friends like us don't
need to play games like that,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Eh eh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non c'è bisogno di fingere.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ti andava di vedermi e basta.
Non è così?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ammettilo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Tra amici non c'è
bisogno di inventarsi scuse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Numara yapmana gerek yok.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Aslında beni görmek istedin, değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Söylesene!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bizim gibi dostların böyle
oyunlara ihtiyacı yok,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
Mi sa che abbiamo finito qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È meglio che vada.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Se resto un altro po',{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} c'è il rischio
che non la smetta più di parlare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ciao!

DE:
So, ich geh dann mal wieder.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Wenn ich länger bleibe, kann ich nur
wieder nicht aufhören zu reden...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Man sieht sich!

TRANSLATION:
Tamam, sanırım artık gitsem iyi
olacak.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}Seninle yürümek güzeldi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}Görüşürüz!
